msgid "### 5.3 Prefill-Decode Disaggregation"
msgstr "### 5.3 Prefill-Decode分离"

msgid ""
"We recommend using Mooncake for deployment: "
"[Mooncake](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)."
msgstr ""
"我们推荐使用Mooncake进行部署：[Mooncake](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)。"

msgid ""
"In the standard single-node deployment mode, Prefill (prompt processing) and"
" Decode (token generation) tasks run on the same set of NPUs. PD (Prefill-"
"Decode) separation addresses this by running Prefill and Decode on dedicated"
" node groups, each configured independently:"
msgstr ""
"在标准的单节点部署模式下，Prefill（提示词处理）和Decode（令牌生成）任务在同一组NPU上运行。PD（Prefill-"
"Decode）分离通过将Prefill和Decode运行在专用的节点组上来解决这一问题，每个节点组独立配置："

msgid ""
"- **Prefill nodes** focus on high-throughput prompt processing, optimized for compute and communication.\n"
"- **Decode nodes** focus on low-latency token generation, optimized for memory bandwidth."
msgstr ""
"- **Prefill节点**专注于高吞吐量的提示词处理，针对计算和通信进行优化。\n"
"- **Decode节点**专注于低延迟的令牌生成，针对内存带宽进行优化。"

msgid ""
"This architecture is recommended for production deployments with concurrent "
"multi-user workloads, where stable latency and high throughput are both "
"required."
msgstr "该架构推荐用于并发多用户负载的生产部署，其中需要同时保证稳定的延迟和高吞吐量。"

msgid ""
"To run the vllm-ascend `Prefill-Decode Disaggregation` service, you need to "
"deploy a `launch_online_dp.py` script and a `run_dp_template.sh` script on "
"each node and deploy a `proxy.sh` script on prefill master node to forward "
"requests."
msgstr ""
"要运行vllm-ascend `Prefill-"
"Decode分离`服务，您需要在每个节点上部署`launch_online_dp.py`脚本和`run_dp_template.sh`脚本，并在prefill主节点上部署`proxy.sh`脚本来转发请求。"

msgid "Parameter descriptions:"
msgstr "参数说明："

msgid "|Parameter|Type|Required|Default|Description|"
msgstr "|参数|类型|必填|默认值|描述|"

msgid ""
"|`--dp-size`|int|Yes|-|Data parallel size (total number of DP ranks across "
"all nodes).|"
msgstr "|`--dp-size`|int|是|-|数据并行大小（所有节点上DP rank的总数）。|"

msgid "|`--tp-size`|int|No|1|Tensor parallel size within each DP rank.|"
msgstr "|`--tp-size`|int|否|1|每个DP rank内的张量并行大小。|"

msgid ""
"|`--dp-size-local`|int|No|(same as `--dp-size`)|Number of DP ranks on the "
"current node. If not set, defaults to `--dp-size`.|"
msgstr ""
"|`--dp-size-local`|int|否|（与`--dp-size`相同）|当前节点上的DP rank数量。如果未设置，默认为`--dp-"
"size`。|"

msgid ""
"|`--dp-rank-start`|int|No|0|Starting rank offset for data parallel ranks on "
"this node.|"
msgstr "|`--dp-rank-start`|int|否|0|此节点上数据并行rank的起始偏移量。|"

msgid ""
"|`--dp-address`|str|Yes|-|IP address of the data parallel master node (node "
"0).|"
msgstr "|`--dp-address`|str|是|-|数据并行主节点（节点0）的IP地址。|"

msgid ""
"|`--dp-rpc-port`|str|No|12345|RPC port for data parallel master "
"communication.|"
msgstr "|`--dp-rpc-port`|str|否|12345|数据并行主节点通信的RPC端口。|"

msgid ""
"|`--vllm-start-port`|int|No|9000|Starting port for each vLLM engine instance"
" on this node. Each DP rank's engine port = `vllm_start_port` + local rank "
"index.|"
msgstr ""
"|`--vllm-start-port`|int|否|9000|此节点上每个vLLM引擎实例的起始端口。每个DP rank的引擎端口 = "
"`vllm_start_port` + 本地rank索引。|"

